<title>SINGAPORE: China buys 50,000t soymeal at $303-$305 C&amp;F-trade.</title>
<headline>China buys 50,000t soymeal at $303-$305 C&amp;F-trade.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has bought 50,000 tonnes of soymeal at a price of around $303-$305 a tonne C&amp;F, Singapore traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The soymeal is for November/December shipment and will come from the United States, the traders said. No further details were available.</p>
<p>- Singapore newsroom (65-8703305)</p>
